              "content": "New task → brief and limits → research → plan approval → implementation → evidence → human review.\n\nConfiguration drafts autosave. Publish makes a new version available to new runs; active runs keep their snapshot.\n\nPause stops scheduling at a safe checkpoint. Resume keeps the same run. Failed checks return to Implement within the retry limit.\n\nDesktop reference: 1440 × 960. Collapse navigation and open secondary panels on demand at narrower widths.",
