                                  "content": "You are working on {{project.name}}.\nTask: {{task.title}}\n\nBefore editing\n• Inspect the existing code and conventions.\n• State assumptions and acceptance criteria.\n• Ask when a decision changes the scope.\n\nDuring implementation\n• Reuse existing modules and patterns.\n• Keep changes focused on the task.\n• Add tests for changed behavior.\n\nBefore handing off\n• Run the relevant checks.\n• Report the exact revision verified.\n• List unresolved risks and findings.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.8,
                                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                                  "fontSize": 12,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
